Every clinician should ask a patient about a continued-opioid-preference.
If a patient has an opioid-pain-effect and the patient has an opioid-function-effect and the patient has an opioid-adverse-effect then every clinician should compare the opioid-pain-effect with the opioid-adverse-effect and should compare the opioid-function-effect with the opioid-adverse-effect.
